# codes:
file "default_which4.sp" deck
  title "default_which4"
  comment " oracle: ngspice-45 run of this deck with `i1 0 n1 1m` and `print v(n1)` added (the test formal_defaults_run_where_the_instance_stands), R53: a .func call in a head default is the definition scope's (lexical), unlike a parameter read; v(n1) = 2 (the top f, x*2, not the wrapper's x*8)"
  func f(x) = x * 2
  subckt s (a b) t=(@f(1k))
    element resistor r1 (a b) value=t
  subckt w (a b)
    func f(x) = x * 8
    element instance xs (a b) model=s
  element instance xw (n1 0) model=w
